                    "{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"§kREDACTED\"},{\"text\":\"§l’s Journal\\n\\n\"},{\"text\":\"The twists and turns and the endless dark space is driving me crazy. \"},{\"text\":\"I can only fight the monsters of the dark for so long. \"}]}",
                    "{\"text\":\"This maze may be the end of my quest for the magic portal, and the end of my life.\"}"
